sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Person
  participant E as Editor
  participant S as Page store (commit)
  participant P as Carry changes to copies
  participant O as Preview, downloads, React

  U->>E: Select a box, Make a component
  E->>S: The box is marked as the MAIN component
  Note over S: Outlined in the editor only,<br/>left out of every output

  U->>E: Add, Your components, click one
  E->>S: A COPY: every box copied,<br/>each remembers the box it copies
  Note over S: A copy is plain boxes:<br/>edit words, pictures and links in place

  U->>E: Edit the MAIN component<br/>(words, looks, add or remove a box)
  E->>S: New version of the page
  S->>P: Compare the main component<br/>before and after
  loop every copy
    P->>P: Still the OLD main value? Take the new one
    P->>P: Changed in this copy? Keep it
    P->>P: Box added or removed? Do the same in the copy
  end
  P-->>S: Page with the copies updated
  S-->>E: ONE undo step (main and copies)

  U->>E: Edit a COPY (words, picture, data item)
  E->>S: Only that copy changes
  Note over P: Later edits of the main component<br/>keep what this copy changed

  U->>E: Undo my changes, Make it a normal box,<br/>Stop being a component, or delete the main one
  E->>S: Reset, detach or release
  S->>P: Main component gone? Copies become normal boxes

  S->>O: Main components left out,<br/>copies written as plain parts
